# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py, the repo-side check that
# the demo's shader copies still match the plugin's (and the script that splices
# them), and crosscheck/, which holds the C++ and JavaScript that compare the
# page's port of the gear train with the plugin's own code, and the frame
# comparison against cgtest; wrangler would otherwise upload them and serve
# them, which is neither useful nor anybody's business.
tools/
